      "message": "For the time being, I think this is ready for review since it unblocks several tests. However I\u0027m inclined to ditch this in favor of doing an IR transformation for all cases that aren\u0027t easily translatable to WGSL where the solution involves hoisting an expression out into statements in the surrounding block (for example for ternaries, assignments-to-swizzle, and possibly for out-param intermediaries as I describe below). Please take a look at my comment below and let me know what you think.",
